/target
*.zip
# Local-only development handoff (contains machine paths; never commit).
# Anchored to the root so it does NOT also ignore docs/migrate.md (the tracked
# user-facing migration guide).
/migrate.md
.claude-env-*
# Transient env files: the resume note and the cross-env inbox. Written during a
# session, deleted on the next boot — never commit one.
*.HANDOFF.md
*.NOTE.md
# Audits are working notes, not project history. Archive them outside the repo;
# they do not go to GitHub.
AUDIT-*.md
# github-cap scaffolds aello its own dogfooding can re-create; aello versions
# itself via Cargo.toml + release.yml, not VERSION/version.yml
/VERSION
/.github/workflows/version.yml
# Running a bundled hook (or a test that imports one) writes bytecode beside the
# source. A .pyc was tracked once and then re-dirtied the tree as a binary diff
# every time a hook ran.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
